        "original_id": "fe26f2b4-9509-54ec-8182-45362b7f6724",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Grigory Drozd, Tony Bellew\n- Organizations: WBC\n- Works: Creed, Rocky franchise\n- Topics: boxing titles, injury, acting debut\n\nFacts:\n- In 2015, Tony Bellew made his acting debut in a supporting role in the sports drama and Rocky franchise spin-off Creed.\n- As of the end of May 2016, Grigory Drozd was the former WBC cruiserweight champion because he lost the title after being unable to defend it due to injury.\n- Tony Bellew won the bout for the open WBC cruiserweight title after Grigory Drozd was unable to defend the title due to injury.",
